  "bindingNotes": [
    "Final build590fb8e5fd15 binds the final B03 planting correction, final interior runs and normal-render performance run.",
    "Daily checks used the earlier V017 build; the final change only reparented two B03 collection plants and refreshed its cubemap. Main park, doors, crops and daily paths were unchanged.",
    "Native overview v006 precedes the B03-only correction; the main park geometry and lighting are identical to the final candidate. Current detail-p03-collection.png records corrected B03 planting.",
    "Inherited glass shader trailing blank-line cleanup after build does not alter shader code. Binary build is local evidence and is excluded from Git.",
    "Image filenames explicitly retain historical and rejected stages; final evaluation uses perf-visible-candidate, never retired hidden or before-b03-fix runs.",
    "Hashes describe local bytes; Git may normalize text line endings. Original Unity scene bytes are also archived as a lossless gzip snapshot.",
    "Original font dirty cache changed during the first build. It is excluded from this commit; exact original font byte preservation is not claimed."
  ],
